# A missing input is the fatal LNK1181 of link.exe; lld-link exits 1181.
# The exit status itself is probed by hand (lit cannot check a status value).

# RUN: yaml2obj %p/Inputs/ret42.yaml -o %t.obj
# RUN: not lld-link /out:%t.exe /entry:main %t.obj nosuch-lnk1181.obj 2>&1 | FileCheck %s

# CHECK: LINK : fatal error LNK1181: cannot open input file 'nosuch-lnk1181.obj'
